'''Bag''' may refer to:

== Enemies ==
* {{e|Colostomia}}, a [[boss]] spawning in [[Dross]].

== Items ==
* {{i|Bag of Crafting}}, an [[activated collectible]] that collects pickups, which can then be used to craft an item.
* {{i|Bomb Bag}}, a [[passive collectible]] that spawns a familiar dropping bombs.
* {{t|Dice Bag}}, a [[trinket]] that grants a Dice item as a consumable per room.
* {{i|IV Bag}}, an [[activated collectible]] that damages Isaac to spawn coins.
* {{i|Punching Bag}}, a [[passive collectible]] that spawns a familier acting as a decoy for monsters.
* {{i|Rune Bag}}, a [[passive collectible]] that spawns a familiar dropping runes.

== Pickups ==
* {{e|Grab Bag}}, a type of [[Sack (Pickup)|sack]] that spawns random pickups.

